{"words": [{"text": "أَوَلَا", "translation": "Do not"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "they know"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُ", "translation": "knows"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "يُسِرُّونَ", "translation": "they conceal"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "يُعْلِنُونَ", "translation": "they declare"}], "sahih": "But do they not know that Allāh knows what they conceal and what they declare?"}